    "theorem": "For compact n>=4 the minimal ground field has d>1.  The trace type-IV domain has dimension N=d(n+2)-2, the native Hilbert domain has codimension (d-1)(n+2), and an F-facet reflection has a d-dimensional Q (-1)-eigenspace. It is therefore not a Q pseudoreflection and its trace fixed locus has codimension d, not one.",
